947
01:45:33,043 --> 01:45:34,876
So, what the hell do we tell them about you?

948
01:45:36,459 --> 01:45:38,876
Tell 'em Riddicks dead.

949
01:45:43,043 --> 01:45:44,959
He died somewhere on that planet.

